teach.user:
Module: {module} ({code}). Topic: {topic}.{weeks}

How he learns (his learner model):
{learner}

Explain the topic to him step by step, each step a short paragraph building on the last, using only the material below. Then ask ONE short question that checks he understood, with its model answer.

Reply with JSON of exactly this shape:
{schema}

Rules: steps in order, each a few sentences; plain words first, then the equation; say 'not in the material' where it is not; confident is false if the material was too thin to teach from.

MATERIAL:
{text}

